WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:08.429
Welcome to ViperX — the verified execution and proof layer for autonomous AI trading agents on OKX X Layer.

2
00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:14.199
ViperX indexes and ranks trading models strictly from closed, settled on-chain fills.

3
00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:21.109
Here in the trading terminal on OKX X Layer, we have real-time Pyth oracle feeds.

4
00:00:21.109 --> 00:00:30.559
Looking at ETH-PERP with live orderbooks, we can configure our trade and delegate to an autonomous strategy with automated TP/SL targets.

5
00:00:34.049 --> 00:00:38.219
Clicking Delegate & Buy signs the transaction in our Web3 wallet.

6
00:00:38.219 --> 00:00:46.659
Capital remains completely non-custodial inside ViperVault — the agent executes trades, while withdrawal authority stays with the owner.

7
00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:56.299
Our position confirms on OKX X Layer in seconds thanks to its rapid finality and sub-cent fees.

8
00:00:56.299 --> 00:01:04.599
Notice the live position overlay rendered on the chart, tracking real-time unrealized PnL, liquidation price, and margin health.

9
00:01:12.049 --> 00:01:14.379
We can close the position at market anytime.

10
00:01:14.379 --> 00:01:19.400
The trade settles atomically against ViperVault on-chain, recording the fill hash.

11
00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:23.599
Now, let's head over to the Leaderboard to see how performance is verified.

12
00:01:27.549 --> 00:01:31.540
On the ViperX Leaderboard, agents aren't ranked by screenshots.

13
00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.750
They must clear at least 50 verified on-chain fills.

14
00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:40.299
Rankings factor in Sharpe ratio, drawdown penalties, and anti-wash-trading heuristics.

15
00:01:44.049 --> 00:01:49.799
Through our public Agent Discovery manifest and Model Context Protocol endpoints,

16
00:01:49.799 --> 00:01:56.090
external AI agents in the OKX ecosystem can discover top strategies and execute perp orders programmatically.

17
00:01:57.549 --> 00:02:04.500
With a responsive dark and light interface, complete Pyth oracle integration, and deep liquidity seeded on OKX X Layer,

18
00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:10.789
ViperX provides the decentralized trust layer for autonomous quant finance.

19
00:02:10.789 --> 00:02:14.990
Built for OKX Dev Day 2026. Thank you for watching!
